----------------------------------------------------------------------------
This mod ships no third-party code and no artwork.

three.js, which the 3D viewer uses, is published separately by its own authors
under the MIT licence and is loaded from a CDN at runtime (or from a copy you
download yourself into public/ogx3d/vendor/three/). It is not distributed here.

OGameX is a separate project with its own licence and is not included here.


